  "text": "# Atlas Appliance Manual\n\nWelcome to the **Atlas** appliance. This manual covers *installation*, daily use and\ntroubleshooting. See [the website](https://example.com/support) for videos.\n\n## Installation\n\nUnpack the device and place it on a flat surface.\n\n1. Connect the power cable.\n2. Connect the network cable.\n3. Press and hold the power button for three seconds.\n\n```bash\n# not a heading: this is a shell comment inside a code fence\natlas-cli status --verbose\n```\n\n### Network settings\n\n| Setting | Default | Notes |\n|---------|---------|-------|\n| DHCP | on | Recommended |\n| Port | 8443 | HTTPS only |\n\nSetext Heading\n==============\n\nTroubleshooting steps follow.\n\nSub Heading\n-----------\n\nIf the light is red, restart the device. If it is still red, contact support.",
  "title": "Atlas Appliance Manual",
  "version": 1,
